{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/13059-amusing-changeling-chronicals-idea","id":13059,"title":"Amusing Changeling Chronicals idea","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-17T16:51:22-08:00","id":13059,"title":"Amusing Changeling Chronicals idea","content":"This is something I'm exploring in my Changeling game, but it may have general applications. What if the Main Antagonist of the Changeling Chronicles is the Narrator? I.E. the ST. What if Changelings were on some level aware they were controlled by a &quot;plot&quot; stringing through their lives, although they can't agree on what that is. Make Story-Crafting a form of rebellion and get a real dynamic between the ST and the Changeling's powers.<br /> <br /> It'd be hard to handle ST vs Changelings without it also being ST vs Players, but it can be done.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-19T09:43:17-08:00","id":14114,"title":"","content":"Technically, as stories and the Wyrd (as active fate) are very important to a Changeling chronicle, you could argue that the storyteller is already the main antagonist in Changeling, because the ST tells the stories that make the lives of the player characters interesting, which is the role of the Wyrd in character.<br /> <br /> EDIT: So I would say go for it, but play up that the 'narator' of their story is the Wyrd, and not a guy sitting at the table gaming. That would probably break suspension of disbelief.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":304,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/304-penta","user":"Penta","date":". 11-19-2013, 12:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/304-penta","name":"Penta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar304_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"617"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-19T16:39:36-08:00","id":14364,"title":"","content":"&quot;This is the story of a man named Stanley....&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-19T23:58:12-08:00","id":14557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SoulGambit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/13059-amusing-changeling-chronicals-idea#post13059\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> What if Changelings were on some level aware they were controlled by a &quot;plot&quot; stringing through their lives, although they can't agree on what that is.</div> </div> </div> </div>I misread &quot;plot&quot; for &quot;pot&quot;.<br /> <br /> I now find this idea far more amusing if you set up a pot as the Big Bad.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-24T23:24:04-08:00","id":17533,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I misread &quot;plot&quot; for &quot;pot&quot;.<br /> <br /> I now find this idea far more amusing if you set up a pot as the Big Bad. </div> </div> </div>And now I have this image of a pot (see: marijuana) plant controlling the stoned masses for its own ends...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1323-askariknight","name":"askariknight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T10:01:27-08:00","id":19241,"title":"","content":"You know, a few years ago, I actually had an idea for a Changeling character whose Keeper was a sort of &quot;Story-Keeper.&quot; He grabbed stories from the mortal world, and grabbed mortals to be characters in those stories. The Changelings were aware of their role in the story, but were locked in to making the same bad choices and suffering the same horrible fates time after time after time after time after time.<br /> <br /> While just about any character could be a great fit from that idea, the one that got me was this guy who escaped because he just couldn't stand knowing that he'd end up one more time next to that river of lava, arms and legs lopped off while his flesh burns. . .","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/4411-my-geist-gmc-updates\" target=\"_blank\">My Geist GMC Updates</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/4348-my-infinite-macabre-goodies\" target=\"_blank\">My Infinite Macabre Goodies</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/4372-parasite-eve-the-third-birthday-chronicle\" target=\"_blank\">Parasite Eve: The Third Birthday Chronicle</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/899558-shamelessly-pimping-my-book\" target=\"_blank\">Shamelessly pimping my book</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/831-erikmodi","name":"ErikModi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T09:18:05-08:00","id":20661,"title":"","content":"The King/Queen of Autumn has had a vision, a prophecy of the one who will end the suffering of the Lost. A young adult, still in high school, will one day lead the Lost to a promise land, free from Fae, hunters, the God-Machine, and shit everything else in the World of Darkness. Only one motley can be trusted with this person's protection, and the players have been given the task. They must sit in their shadow and protect this Messiah from any danger. But can they protect him/her from... NOT HAVING A PROM DATE?!<br /> <br /> Join the motley with the most as they try to take their zero and turn him/her into a hero. High school crushes, math tests, and a never ending desire to tweet are the world of this future Lost leader, and it's up to the players to push him/her in the right direction. What do they do when their charge comes to them for advice? How do they react when their savior gets dumped at the Big Dance? And when are they going to give him/her a make-over?<br /> <br /> It's time to stop getting schooled, and start getting Lost.<br /> <br /> rated PG-13<br /> <br /> ************************************************** ***********************<br /> <br /> Woops, misread the thread title as a <b>place</b> to post amusing chronicle ideas. I'll delete this if the OP wants me to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But that would be *shudders* <i>fun</i>!<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":119,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","user":"Strapping Gent","date":". 11-30-2013, 12:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/119-strapping-gent","name":"Strapping Gent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}